Package: jpDMEQR
Type: Package
Title: Debiased Profile Inference for High-Dimensional Mixed-Effects Quantile Regression
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Jian", family = "Hou", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "houjian@ruc.edu.cn")
Author: Jian Hou [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jian Hou <houjian@ruc.edu.cn>
Description: Regularised profile estimation and coordinate-wise debiased
    inference for high-dimensional mixed-effects quantile regression with
    many independent small clusters. Convex selection with cluster score
    loadings is followed by an unpenalised profile refit. Paired bandwidth
    scores and their exact Jacobian determine the one-step correction and
    cluster sandwich uncertainty. Population target and precision direction
    assets retain their numerical diagnostics and method identity.
